OL,3,APutin's Crimean Bridge partly collapses
OL,4,Aas Zelensky hails 'unprecedented'
OL,5,Aattack by Ukraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkraine has severely damaged a critical
OL,8,Fbridge linking Russia to occupied
OL,9,FCrimea, in what President Volodymyr
OL,10,FZelensky says was an "unprecedented
OL,11,Foperation" weeks in the making.
OL,13,FImages shared by Ukrainian officials
OL,14,Fshow a section of the Crimean Bridge
OL,15,Fcollapsed into the water, dealing a
OL,16,Flogistical and symbolic blow to
OL,17,FMoscow's war effort.
OL,19,FThe Kremlin said it would rebuild the
OL,20,Fbridge "better than before".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
