OL,3,APutin's Crimean Bridge partly collapses
OL,4,Aas Zelensky hails 'unprecedented'
OL,5,Aattack by Ukraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile in Kyiv, Mayor Vitaliy
OL,8,FKlitschko said traffic had partially
OL,9,Fresumed on the Pivnichnyi (Northern)
OL,10,Fand Pivdennyi (Southern) bridges - key
OL,11,Fcrossings over the Dnipro River - after
OL,12,Fthey had been closed following Russian
OL,13,Fstrikes overnight.
